2692+ 6AB2              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2693+ 6AB2              ; search_by_Busy_dir
2694+ 6AB2              ; Bank-safe replacement used by FIND for names returned by get_item_name.
2695+ 6AB2              ; IN:  HL = physical name start, BC = 16-bit name length
2696+ 6AB2              ;      item_name_page = bank companion for HL
2697+ 6AB2              ; Pattern remains INPBUFF, pattern length is the value patched into txtlen+1.
2698+ 6AB2              ; OUT: Z=pattern found, NZ=not found
2699+ 6AB2              ; One-character input matches only the FIRST character of a name (quick jump).
2700+ 6AB2              ; Two or more characters use normal case-insensitive substring search. There is
2701+ 6AB2              ; no 255-byte directory-name limit; directory page crossings are transparent.
2702+ 6AB2              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2703+ 6AB2              ; --- DOKUMENTACE CZ: search_by_Busy_dir ---
2704+ 6AB2              ; Ucel: Vyhledá vzor ve jménu; zvolí rychlou nebo stránkovanou variantu.
2705+ 6AB2              ; Vstup: HL = jméno, BC = délka, item_name_page = banka; INPBUFF = malá písmena vzoru, txtlen+1
2706+ 6AB2              ;   = délka vzoru.
2707+ 6AB2              ; Vystup: Z = shoda, NZ = nenalezeno.
2708+ 6AB2              ; Meni: AF, BC, DE, HL, BC'; IX a IY zachovány.
2709+ 6AB2              ; Poznamka: Jednoznakový vzor porovnává jen začátek jména; může změnit mapování RAM.
2710+ 6AB2              ; --- KONEC DOKUMENTACE CZ ---
2711+ 6AB2              search_by_Busy_dir:
2712+ 6AB2                      ; Empty name cannot contain a non-empty search pattern.
2713+ 6AB2 78                   ld      a,b
2714+ 6AB3 B1                   or      c
2715+ 6AB4 28 2A                jr      z,.dir_search_not_found_fast
2716+ 6AB6
2717+ 6AB6                      ; Map the directory bank containing the first byte of the name ONCE.
2718+ 6AB6                      ; For the normal case the whole name is inside this one 16K bank and
2719+ 6AB6                      ; no further paging is needed during FIND.
